# Manual-QA scratch: ignore the contents, keep the small committed fixtures the
# CV Scanner tests read. A directory that is itself excluded cannot be
# re-included from within, hence `/qa-files/*` rather than `/qa-files/`.
# Deliberately still out: kegedean.pdf, a 21 MB oversize-upload sample.
/qa-files/*
!/qa-files/cv-sample.pdf
!/qa-files/cv-sample.docx
!/qa-files/cv-sample.txt
!/qa-files/deliverable.pdf
